		(uuid "1368889e-14c2-54f3-a5ac-3ce876bd7258")
	)
	(text "Notes\n1. Read off the PDF by eye (it has no text layer); connectivity checked against an independent net-by-net transcription of the PDF.\n2. KiCad library symbols with the PDF's pin numbers. USB shell pins S1-S4 are the one SH pin of the KiCad USB-C symbol.\n3. U1: the PDF prints no part number; its symbol (project library XIAO_ESP32C3) asserts none.\n4. U2: project copy of KiCad's XC6210B332MR with pin 4 (NC) shown, because the PDF connects C13 (DNP) to it.\n5. Parts the PDF marks DNP (C11, C12, C13, R3, R21, J1, J2) carry the value DNP; the KiCad DNP attribute is not set.\n6. PWR_FLAG and no-connect flags are additions for ERC; they are not in the PDF.\n7. Footprints: KiCad library defaults only (U2 SOT-23-5, U4 QFN-32). All other parts are unassigned.\n8. The PDF's unnumbered designators USB, ANT, BAT, GND, BOOT, RST, CHG are USB1, ANT1, BAT1, GND1, BOOT1, RST1, CHG1 here: KiCad treats a reference without a number as unannotated."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 280 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5fcea72c-a25c-5b1a-b0b1-233da2b66d7f")
	)
